    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Baron’s Glorious Arena</sup></p>\n<p>Whenever you assume an approach, choose 1 skill, plus an additional skill for every 5 ranks in Disguise you possess. As long as you maintain that approach, the DC of any skill checks made to learn information about you with the chosen skills is increased by 4 + 2 for every 5 ranks in Disguise you possess.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/subterfuge#toc26\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
